  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.2.0 - Folder Operations Update\n            - NEW: BulkMoveAsync() - Move multiple files at once\n            - NEW: ListFoldersAsync() - Get list of all unique folders\n            - NEW: DeleteFolderAsync() - Delete folder and all contents\n            - ENHANCED: Better folder filtering in search operations\n            - Improved nested folder navigation support\n            \n            Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release\n            - Complete IFileStorage implementation for Azure Blob Storage\n            - SAS token generation for signed URLs\n            - Access tier support (Hot, Cool, Archive)\n            - Thumbnail generation and caching in blobs",
